WEBVTT

00:25.630 --> 00:26.500
<b>Here's the lightime!</b>

00:26.710 --> 00:28.710
<b>Will you guys click the follow botton?</b>

00:28.710 --> 00:29.370
<b>Come on!</b>

00:30.290 --> 00:31.580
<b>Lu Guang,say something!</b>

00:33.380 --> 00:34.830
<b>Follow us,please!</b>

00:42.250 --> 00:44.670
<b>The security in the police 
station is nearly perfect.</b>

00:45.250 --> 00:47.290
<b>They will notice your actions in notime</b>

00:48.960 --> 00:50.670
<b>Once a large manhunt is launched,</b>

00:51.210 --> 00:52.960
<b>it will be impossible to escape,</b>

00:52.960 --> 00:54.120
<b>no matter what magical power you have</b>

00:55.130 --> 00:57.460
<b>So the only way out,</b>

00:58.960 --> 01:01.000
<b>is going trough the back 
streets of the police station</b>

01:02.710 --> 01:04.670
<b>However, all the streets 
around the police station</b>

01:04.670 --> 01:07.210
<b>have surveillance cameras 
at different places.</b>

01:07.630 --> 01:10.040
<b>If I send a car to pick you up, it 
will definitely be caught on camera.</b>

01:11.040 --> 01:12.750
<b>Then our trail after that,</b>

01:12.750 --> 01:14.040
<b>will also be followed</b>

01:15.830 --> 01:17.460
<b>To avoid these surveillance cameras</b>

01:18.750 --> 01:20.370
<b>we can only rely on other means,</b>

01:26.670 --> 01:29.080
<b>which may require some physical effort.</b>

01:45.750 --> 01:46.540
<b>Wang Juan</b>

01:47.250 --> 01:49.000
<b>Case closed? So fast.</b>

01:50.750 --> 01:52.420
<b>Where are you taking them?</b>

01:55.330 --> 01:56.370
<b>It's not over yet.</b>

01:56.580 --> 01:58.040
<b>I'm taking them out for some fresh air</b>

01:58.250 --> 01:59.460
<b>and something to eat.</b>

02:01.500 --> 02:03.040
<b>It's quite late. You haven't had dinner?</b>

02:03.460 --> 02:04.290
<b>What about Captain Xiao?</b>

02:04.380 --> 02:05.730
<b>No time for a meal either?</b>

02:06.290 --> 02:09.120
<b>Right, I'll grab some for him later.</b>

02:10.750 --> 02:11.710
<b>Then go ahead.</b>

02:18.210 --> 02:20.330
<b>Ipt's rare to see Wang smile so brightly.</b>

02:20.580 --> 02:22.000
<b>Isn't that good?</b>

02:22.290 --> 02:23.830
<b>She's always pulling a long face.</b>

02:26.920 --> 02:28.500
<b>When you exit the back door 
of the police station,</b>

02:28.710 --> 02:30.580
<b>just head straight into 
the opposite neighborhood.</b>

02:31.000 --> 02:33.920
<b>There are still many surveillance cameras 
along the roads and inside the neighborhood,</b>

02:34.500 --> 02:36.500
<b>but as soon as you pass through this area</b>

02:37.130 --> 02:40.790
<b>you will enter an old town under renovation.</b>

02:42.000 --> 02:43.420
<b>The residents have been relocated,</b>

02:43.630 --> 02:45.040
<b>and the houses are demolished halfway.</b>

02:45.500 --> 02:47.830
<b>so the surveillance system is obsolete.</b>

02:49.500 --> 02:52.170
<b>I will arrange several 
vehicles near the old town</b>

02:52.380 --> 02:54.040
<b>to distract the police's attention</b>

02:58.000 --> 03:00.460
<b>This area is like a dense fog</b>

03:01.790 --> 03:04.120
<b>No one will be able to find you anymore.</b>

05:07.460 --> 05:08.290
<b>Hey, you see</b>

05:08.500 --> 05:09.670
<b>Captain Xiao has always been conservative</b>

05:09.670 --> 05:11.420
<b>and still hasn't explained the case to us</b>

05:11.880 --> 05:13.120
<b>He just let us stay here and keep watch.</b>

05:14.130 --> 05:15.500
<b>What's going on?</b>

05:16.830 --> 05:18.920
<b>It's said that the person 
named Lu Guang in the ward</b>

05:18.920 --> 05:21.330
<b>and the one who left before, Cheng 
Xiaoshi, have special abilities.</b>

05:21.920 --> 05:23.120
<b>But who knows</b>

05:23.130 --> 05:25.120
<b>No one knows what they are capable of</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:30.370
<b>I also heard that the criminal Captain Xiao 
is looking for has special abilities too.</b>

05:30.670 --> 05:32.790
<b>Seems able to let their soul leaves the body</b>

05:32.790 --> 05:34.170
<b>And possess other people's bodies.</b>

05:37.040 --> 05:39.790
<b>No wonder they told us to be cautious 
of each other's unusual behavior.</b>

05:42.210 --> 05:43.000
<b>Hey</b>

05:43.790 --> 05:47.040
<b>You two wouldn't happen to 
have been possessed, right?</b>

05:47.420 --> 05:50.370
<b>Is it safe to leave Lu 
Guang alone in the ward?</b>

05:50.670 --> 05:52.830
<b>If he gets controlled, 
wouldn't it be dangerous?</b>

05:54.250 --> 05:56.750
<b>But he doesn't want us to stay in the ward,</b>

05:56.750 --> 05:59.250
<b>and we've checked the 
room for dangerous items.</b>

06:05.710 --> 06:07.250
<b>Mr. Lu,Mr.Lu!</b>

06:09.710 --> 06:11.250
<b>Damn it, it's locked.</b>

06:13.040 --> 06:13.920
<b>Break the door open!</b>

06:24.580 --> 06:26.120
<b>You two, check downstairs now.</b>

06:26.130 --> 06:27.250
<b>I'm calling Captain Xiao.</b>

06:33.670 --> 06:34.920
<b>Captain Xiao, bad news.</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:36.000
<b>Lu Guang is missing.</b>

06:36.380 --> 06:37.250
<b>What did you say?</b>

06:37.380 --> 06:38.460
<b>Lu Guang is missing?!</b>

06:38.630 --> 06:40.920
<b>We broke in and found the window broken</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:42.620
<b>So we thought Mr. Lu had an accident</b>

06:53.130 --> 06:55.710
<b>But we couldn't find him on 
the first floor or in his room</b>

06:58.000 --> 07:00.000
<b>Send more people to inspect 
the scene right now</b>

07:00.460 --> 07:01.500
<b>Review the hospital surveillance footage.</b>

07:01.500 --> 07:02.620
<b>And start the investigation</b>

07:05.210 --> 07:06.830
<b>How could Lu Guang disappear into air?</b>

07:08.500 --> 07:10.330
<b>Could there be other people with 
special abilities that we don't know?</b>

07:14.420 --> 07:16.330
<b>Why did Wang Juan take them out?!</b>

07:18.580 --> 07:19.370
<b>Officer Wang,</b>

07:21.330 --> 07:22.120
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi,</b>

07:27.420 --> 07:28.210
<b>Hello, Captain Xiao,</b>

07:28.290 --> 07:29.770
<b>There's no one in the 
women's restroom. They..</b>

07:29.770 --> 07:29.790
<b>I just checked the surveillance footage
There's no one in the women's restroom. They..</b>

07:29.790 --> 07:30.920
<b>I just checked the surveillance footage</b>

07:31.170 --> 07:33.290
<b>They probably have escaped from 
the police station by now.</b>

07:33.330 --> 07:34.170
<b>Officer Wang</b>

07:35.040 --> 07:35.960
<b>That doesn't make sense.</b>

07:36.330 --> 07:37.830
<b>What happened?</b>

07:37.830 --> 07:38.830
<b>What about Cheng Xiaoshi?</b>

07:39.130 --> 07:40.370
<b>I have no clue either</b>

07:40.960 --> 07:41.830
<b>Anyway,</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:44.080
<b>we must not let them get away!</b>

07:48.310 --> 07:49.150
<b>Liu,</b>

07:49.330 --> 07:50.960
<b>Did you see where Wang Juan went?</b>

07:52.880 --> 07:54.370
<b>Weren't they going to have dinner?</b>

07:55.540 --> 07:57.040
<b>They went across the street.</b>

07:58.960 --> 08:00.830
<b>She also said she would bring you some food</b>

08:01.210 --> 08:02.040
<b>What's wrong?</b>

08:03.500 --> 08:05.870
<b>Liu, inform the team to 
request reinforcements.</b>

08:07.040 --> 08:07.670
<b>OK</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:09.870
<b>And seal off the nearby areas.</b>

08:10.130 --> 08:11.790
<b>No vehicle is allowed to leave.</b>

08:13.670 --> 08:14.460
<b>WangJuan</b>

08:19.040 --> 08:21.540
<b>Wang Juan, Cheng Xiaoshi</b>

08:28.960 --> 08:29.770
<b>Captain Xiao</b>

08:32.770 --> 08:33.560
<b>Captain Xiao</b>

08:33.580 --> 08:34.420
<b>I'm here</b>

08:40.790 --> 08:41.580
<b>Captain Xiao</b>

08:45.330 --> 08:46.210
<b>Your officer ID</b>

08:46.960 --> 08:47.960
<b>77450</b>

08:50.210 --> 08:51.540
<b>Why did you take them away?</b>

08:52.330 --> 08:54.710
<b>I, I don't know.</b>

08:55.420 --> 08:57.540
<b>I can only recall that I was at the 
entrance of the women's restroom.</b>

08:57.960 --> 08:58.790
<b>What did you say?</b>

08:59.210 --> 09:00.040
<b>I can't hear you.</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:03.290
<b>Why did you come at such a perfect timing?</b>

09:03.830 --> 09:06.710
<b>Just when I asked to go to the restroom?</b>

09:07.420 --> 09:08.420
<b>Ask again</b>

09:08.710 --> 09:12.830
<b>I'm asking, why did you come 
at such a perfect timing?</b>

09:13.710 --> 09:16.830
<b>Just when l asked to go to the restroom?</b>

09:17.790 --> 09:19.920
<b>Have you been listening in the whole time?</b>

09:20.540 --> 09:22.710
<b>Then, I couldn't remember anything</b>

09:23.580 --> 09:24.870
<b>When I regained consciousness,</b>

09:25.170 --> 09:26.460
<b>I found myseIf being handcuffed here</b>

09:27.000 --> 09:28.620
<b>I could do nothing but watch them run away.</b>

09:29.630 --> 09:30.870
<b>You wll guide the reinforcements later.</b>

09:31.290 --> 09:33.080
<b>Surround them in this old town area.</b>

09:36.630 --> 09:38.620
<b>Did you see where they ran in the end?</b>

09:39.250 --> 09:40.000
<b>By the way,</b>

09:43.630 --> 09:46.120
<b>The listening device on Cheng 
Xiaoshi has a tracking signal.</b>

09:46.920 --> 09:49.540
<b>So now we can only rely on you 
to bring in the listening device.</b>

09:49.880 --> 09:51.750
<b>Come on, let me see where to put it.</b>

09:58.500 --> 09:59.420
<b>I'll go after them.</b>

09:59.880 --> 10:02.250
<b>Take my phone and stay in 
contact with the reinforcements</b>

10:34.250 --> 10:35.080
<b>Hello,</b>

10:37.000 --> 10:39.000
<b>Captain Xiao, where are you?p</b>

10:39.000 --> 10:39.830
<b>Qiao Ling,</b>

10:40.210 --> 10:41.000
<b>This is Wang Juan.</b>

10:41.420 --> 10:43.710
<b>Captain Xiao took my phone 
and went after Cheng Xiaoshi.</b>

10:44.420 --> 10:46.920
<b>Officer Wang, why did you 
take Cheng Xiaoshi away?</b>

10:46.920 --> 10:48.290
<b>What on earth happened?</b>

10:48.580 --> 10:49.670
<b>Where's Cheng Xiaoshi?</b>

10:51.250 --> 10:52.120
<b>Where are you?</b>

10:52.130 --> 10:52.500
<b>I'm coming.</b>

10:52.500 --> 10:53.290
<b>Qiao Ling,</b>

10:53.670 --> 10:54.540
<b>calm down.</b>

10:55.000 --> 10:56.120
<b>Don't come over.</b>

10:57.130 --> 10:58.370
<b>It's very dangerous here right now.</b>

11:01.130 --> 11:02.750
<b>Officer Wang, Officer Wang</b>

11:03.000 --> 11:04.500
<b>What's your problem?</b>

11:04.920 --> 11:07.500
<b>Sir, have you seen where Officer Wang went?</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:11.330
<b>She just took two people to have dinner</b>

11:11.630 --> 11:13.370
<b>Captain Xiao asked me to 
call for reinforcements.</b>

11:13.500 --> 11:15.870
<b>Wait, what happened to you all?</b>

11:20.290 --> 11:21.370
<b>Hey, don't run around.</b>

11:25.500 --> 11:26.370
<b>If everything goes smoothly,</b>

11:26.830 --> 11:29.790
<b>it will take you about 8 minutes 
to leave the police station,</b>

11:29.790 --> 11:31.040
<b>pass through the neighborhood 
and reach the old town.</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:35.080
<b>Considering the response and action 
time of the police reinforcements,</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:37.040
<b>which should take about 20 minutes.</b>

11:37.500 --> 11:40.500
<b>you must leave no later than 19: 20.</b>

11:44.960 --> 11:45.790
<b>Of course,</b>

11:45.790 --> 11:46.960
<b>just in case,</b>

11:47.250 --> 11:48.750
<b>I will also make some arrangements</b>

11:49.500 --> 11:50.620
<b>to delay</b>

11:50.630 --> 11:52.750
<b>their tracking.</b>

12:03.290 --> 12:04.670
<b>This time,</b>

12:04.670 --> 12:07.080
<b>I won't fail again</b>

12:19.960 --> 12:20.830
<b>Damn it</b>

12:21.460 --> 12:22.960
<b>Seriouly, no signal at this moment?</b>

12:46.580 --> 12:47.460
<b>What's wrong?</b>

12:47.830 --> 12:49.170
<b>Could it be not a signal issue?</b>

12:49.710 --> 12:51.040
<b>Why do they stay still?</b>

13:11.420 --> 13:13.080
<b>Why do you cheat again?</b>

13:13.960 --> 13:16.210
<b>I kindly gave you another chance.</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:21.210
<b>But you.</b>

13:22.290 --> 13:23.870
<b>How can we cooperate ike this?</b>

13:24.420 --> 13:25.290
<b>Sorry.</b>

13:26.210 --> 13:26.960
<b>From now on</b>

13:27.830 --> 13:29.080
<b>It won't happen again.</b>

13:50.630 --> 13:51.420
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi</b>

13:55.920 --> 13:57.790
<b>Move aside, police business</b>

14:03.630 --> 14:04.500
<b>Sorry.</b>

14:05.130 --> 14:06.500
<b>Even if you're a police officer</b>

14:06.960 --> 14:09.290
<b>You can't pass through this road.</b>

14:38.960 --> 14:40.170
<b>Seriously?</b>

14:40.630 --> 14:43.170
<b>I thought policewomen 
would be easy to handle.</b>

14:43.540 --> 14:44.370
<b>Why?</b>

14:44.710 --> 14:46.080
<b>Why can't I win?</b>

14:49.250 --> 14:50.500
<b>I can't fail again.</b>

14:50.920 --> 14:51.960
<b>I'll be killed.</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:53.460
<b>I'll be killed.</b>

18:03.920 --> 18:05.580
<b>You can't catch up.</b>

18:08.580 --> 18:12.040
<b>It's better to care about that policewoman.</b>

18:14.580 --> 18:15.960
<b>Stop stop, please</b>

18:15.960 --> 18:17.080
<b>Spare me, Madam</b>

18:17.080 --> 18:17.830
<b>Spare me</b>

18:18.710 --> 18:19.960
<b>Just handcuff me.</b>

18:20.080 --> 18:21.330
<b>Take me back to the police station.</b>

18:21.330 --> 18:23.080
<b>I will confess everything. OK?</b>

18:23.630 --> 18:24.460
<b>Stand up.</b>

18:35.830 --> 18:36.710
<b>Boss..</b>

18:36.710 --> 18:39.580
<b>Was my acting to distract 
her attention good enough?</b>

18:40.630 --> 18:41.670
<b>Put on the mask.</b>

18:47.920 --> 18:49.540
<b>I told you to delay them.</b>

18:49.880 --> 18:51.120
<b>What are you guys doing?</b>

18:51.920 --> 18:54.460
<b>I didn't expect this woman to be so good.</b>

18:56.000 --> 18:57.370
<b>I worked with her before.</b>

18:58.040 --> 18:59.790
<b>She's known for being skilled 
in combat in the team.</b>

19:00.540 --> 19:03.290
<b>Well, now she has seen your face.</b>

19:07.380 --> 19:09.370
<b>We can't let her live.</b>

19:28.330 --> 19:29.080
<b>WangJuan</b>

19:31.830 --> 19:32.620
<b>WangJuan</b>

20:14.630 --> 20:16.170
<b>It seems everything is going smoothly.</b>

20:22.790 --> 20:23.670
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi</b>

20:30.670 --> 20:32.000
<b>Why did you go with her?</b>

20:32.080 --> 20:34.460
<b>I didn't expect you to find 
us faster than the police</b>

20:35.630 --> 20:37.250
<b>But it's of no use</b>

20:38.130 --> 20:39.250
<b>We will go by water.</b>

20:40.130 --> 20:41.920
<b>How could you possibly catch up?</b>

20:43.130 --> 20:43.920
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi</b>

21:31.290 --> 21:33.580
<b>Fortunately, I caught up.</b>
